OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AHow one man became the unsung hero of
OL,4,Athe internet during a cyber-security
OL,5,Ascramble
OL,6,
OL,7,FFor more than 20 years, OndEYej Sury
OL,8,Fhas been quietly helping to keep
OL,9,Fwebsites around the world running
OL,10,Fsecurely, largely in his spare time.
OL,12,FHe voluntarily maintains software for
OL,13,Ftwo of the most popular versions of
OL,14,FLinux, a free operating system similar
OL,15,Fto Windows, which are often used on web
OL,16,Fservers.
OL,18,FTypically, this involves keeping them
OL,19,Fup-to-date with the latest version of
OL,20,FPHP, a programming language which
OL,21,Funderpins a significant number of the
OL,22,Fworld's websites.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/17
